OL,3,GNEWSAFamily fear for missing hydropower
OL,4,Aworker after Nepal flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman in Wales says she has "lost
OL,7,Fhope" as she awaits news of a family
OL,8,Fmember in Nepal who is missing
OL,9,Ffollowing the massive flash flood last
OL,10,Fweek.
OL,12,FJyoti Upadhyay, who is from Nepal but
OL,13,Fhas lived in Tal-y-bont in Ceredigion
OL,14,Ffor the past five years, said she and
OL,15,Fher husband had not been able to find
OL,16,Fout anything about the whereabouts of
OL,17,Fhydropower station worker Jit Bahadur
OL,18,FChaudhary.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,437,430,260,140,0,100
