OL,3,GNEWSAFamily fear for missing hydropower
OL,4,Aworker after Nepal flood
OL,5,
OL,6,FChaudhary, who is not a blood relation
OL,7,Fbut is considered family by Upadhyay as
OL,8,Fhe has lived with her mother-in-law for
OL,9,Fthe past 25 years, was working at the
OL,10,FTrishuli 3B site in the Bagmati
OL,11,FProvince.
OL,13,F"To be honest, since Saturday we have
OL,14,Flost hope," said Upadhyay.
